<programme channel="IN8000186A" start="20261031140045 +0000" stop="20261031145955 +0000">
    <title>THE NILE DAM CONFLICT ETHIOPIA VS EGYPT AND SUDAN</title>
    <desc>The Nile Is No Longer Just A River, It'S A Geopolitical Battleground. As Ethiopia'S Grand Renaissance Dam Challenges Decades Of Egyptian Control Over Africa'S Lifeline, Tensions Surge Toward Conflict. From Soaring Ambitions To Military Brinkmanship, This Documentary Follows The People And Nations Fighting For Every Drop Of The World'S Most Contested River.</desc>
