    <title>How Do They Do It S14 - "Oyster Knives, Stadium Lights, Diamonds"</title>
    <desc>How do they forge the blades to crack open oyster shells? Plus, how do scientists in a lab grow the synthetic diamonds of the future?</desc>
  </programme>
  
