<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261031233001 +0000" stop="20261101000006 +0000">
    <title>Behind The Draw</title>
    <desc>On just 40 acres in Missouri, Mike has built one of the most consistent stand setups we’ve ever seen. He’s killed 3 mature bucks in 4 years from this ONE stand… and it’s not by accident. In this video, we break down exactly why this stand is so deadly—from access and wind to natural movement and terrain—and then take it a step further. We’re improving the setup with bedding thickets and hinge cutting to make it even harder for bucks to avoid. If you’re hunting a smaller property, this is a blueprint you can apply right now.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101000006 +0000" stop="20261101001637 +0000">
    <title>Hunting Land Man</title>
    <desc>In this episode, Slade ends the saga with a deer he has watched for a few years, Pope. On a previous episode you saw Slade put in all of the work with feeder and food plot strategy to make the stars align. Make sure you watch that episode as well to see the behind the scenes work it took to bring Pope to 25 yards.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101001637 +0000" stop="20261101003005 +0000">
    <title>Hunting Land Man</title>
    <desc>In this episode, Slade and his brother Tai take us around a new investment property - a 55 acre tract in Wilkinson County, MS and go over what it took to take an undesirable raw tract, to a place with multiple offers on the first day it was put on the market.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101003005 +0000" stop="20261101010006 +0000">
    <title>200</title>
    <desc>When it comes to hunting Texas whitetails, few do it better than Tarif Alkhatib. This episode captures his incredible double success story, proving that with the right preparation and unwavering focus, even the most elusive big bucks can meet their match.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101010006 +0000" stop="20261101013006 +0000">
    <title>Wildbound by Forloh</title>
    <desc>In part 2 of the British episodes, Andy visits the majestic land of Scotland. Here he is introduced to Scottish deer stalking, a type of hunting that is full of history and etiquette. He hunts ‘monarch’ stags and goes into the Atlantic waters to find some of the freshest shellfish on the planet which he, and Mike Robinson cook and eat. Concluding the British episodes in a place as wild as Scotland really sets the tone for the series.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101013006 +0000" stop="20261101020001 +0000">
    <title>Canadian Whitetail</title>
    <desc>A tough slog of a season for Kenny Hayworth as he bowhunts Saskatchewan.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101020001 +0000" stop="20261101023001 +0000">
    <title>HuntStand Presents</title>
    <desc>Massive wildfires had consumed thousands of acres across the Bighorn Mountains and the neighboring foothills. Would the annual HuntStand pronghorn camp be a total bust, or would the crew be able to find a few animals beyond the smoke?</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101023001 +0000" stop="20261101033005 +0000">
    <title>The WoodHaven Way</title>
    <desc>November 5th turned into one of those rut days you never forget. After spending the previous two seasons focused on a single buck, Josh Sparks with Midwest Whitetail entered the 2025 season with a fresh opportunity on the Gridiron Farm, a permission property brought into the fold by his good friend Casey. From chasing spring turkeys to putting in work throughout the off-season, Josh and the crew spent months making improvements to the farm and learning how the deer used it.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101033005 +0000" stop="20261101040005 +0000">
    <title>Hard Truths of Conservation</title>
    <desc>Big horn sheep are one of North America’s most spectacular animals, but future conservation requires large-scale, hands-on efforts. Joining a multi-agency translocation in Texas, Dan Cabela is in the thick of it.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101040005 +0000" stop="20261101042233 +0000">
    <title>Realtree Road Trips</title>
    <desc>Join Greg Camp and Jacob Shadrik for an unforgettable early October bow hunt in the heart of Nebraska. With crisp fall mornings, perfect conditions and plenty of deer movement, both Greg and Jacob had incredible hunts on two stunning 10-point bucks.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101042233 +0000" stop="20261101043028 +0000">
    <title>Realtree Roadtrips</title>
    <desc>Tyler Jordan hunts one of the biggest bucks on Realtree Farms with his brother Colton.  Colton and his Dad Bill, have seen this buck several times over the last few days not he and Tyler make a move hoping to get Colton a shot at this giant Georgia whitetail.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101043028 +0000" stop="20261101045234 +0000">
    <title>Realtree Road Trips</title>
    <desc>Join Michael Pitts and Rigsby Stewart as they battle through the highs and lows of a tough Kentucky bowhunting season.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101045234 +0000" stop="20261101050017 +0000">
    <title>Realtree Roadtrips</title>
    <desc>Tyler Jordan hosts Turkeys For Tomorrow (TFT) hunt sweepstakes winner Troy Martin from Kentucky on a hunt at Realtree Farms. The morning started off good with warmer temperatures and multiple turkeys gobbling on the roost. After setting up in the hardwoods on the edge of a field, a few longbeards pitch down and come straight to the call. It results in a quick hunt on a beautiful morning. To become a member of TFT, and to support its many conservation efforts to ensure we have healthy turkeys populations in the future, click the link below.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101050017 +0000" stop="20261101053006 +0000">
    <title>Realtree Road Trips</title>
    <desc>Join Tyler Jordan, Brandon Sheppard, and Brantley Richardson as they hit the woods in Georgia during the peak of the November rut! Then, Tyler heads to Kansas in search of big Midwestern bucks.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101053006 +0000" stop="20261101055224 +0000">
    <title>Realtree Road Trips</title>
    <desc>Former MLB superstar Chipper Jones trades the ballfield for Iowa timber—and what happens on his first day is the stuff every bowhunter dreams about.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-5fd115b8b7ef8d002dcf1817" start="20261101055224 +0000" stop="20261101060006 +0000">
    <title>Realtree Roadtrips</title>
